WEBVTT

00:00:13.370 --> 00:00:16.120
It's time. Let's go.

00:00:19.660 --> 00:00:21.830
So you did come.

00:00:21.830 --> 00:00:26.040
Join the squad, but you're
going to have to lead the attack.

00:00:26.040 --> 00:00:29.580
We won't have to write
another apology even if you die.

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:30.870
Let's go.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:38.080
So you did come, Krylancelo.

00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:44.830
Comicron...

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:49.370
Everyone here's experienced.
Of course, I'd know a few of them.

00:00:49.370 --> 00:00:52.500
I can't let my emotions get the best of me.

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:55.410
I'm going to protect her, no matter what.

00:02:33.790 --> 00:02:36.910
Normally, you would
need permission from the king

00:02:36.910 --> 00:02:41.250
to create a squad with this many Sorcerers,

00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:44.370
so this expedition is
definitely not a legal one.

00:02:44.370 --> 00:02:46.000
Not to mention...

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:52.120
Is that White Sorcerer going to be
able to seal Azalie's White Sorcery?

00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:56.660
I just figured there might be a chance
he'd be useful, so I had him tag along.

00:02:56.660 --> 00:03:01.750
There's no guarantee that a
White Sorcerer can seal White Sorcery.

00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:06.330
It's like having a blade drawn to stop
someone with a knife coming for you.

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:11.580
So you gathered all these people knowing
very well that sacrifices might be made.

00:03:13.540 --> 00:03:16.660
You don't care how many might
perish from Azalie's first attack.

00:03:16.660 --> 00:03:20.950
As long as one of you survive
long enough to blow her brains out.

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:23.040
Everyone here is aware of the risks.

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:30.870
The silent band of Sorcerers continued
their trek for what seemed like eternity.

00:03:30.870 --> 00:03:34.080
But they knew that it
wasn't going to be eternity.

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:37.580
Once they tracked her down,
their battle would begin.

00:03:39.160 --> 00:03:42.950
"HEED MY CALL, BEAST"

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:49.620
How are we going to walk?

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:52.950
If you don't like it, leave!
But you're not getting a cut of this.

00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:55.410
What do you mean by cut?

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:59.290
If we capture that monster,
we'll definitely be able to sell it for a ton...

00:03:59.290 --> 00:04:02.000
And that sword the monster has, too!

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:04.410
What are you talking about?!

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:08.290
The reason I had you cleared of fraud
charges and got you out of that cell

00:04:08.290 --> 00:04:12.160
is to help Orphen!

00:04:12.160 --> 00:04:13.290
You want a piece of me?!

00:04:13.290 --> 00:04:17.040
I'll have you know that
I'm very skilled with the sword.

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:19.660
I'm even in the War Club at school!

00:04:19.660 --> 00:04:21.290
What the heck kind of club is that?!

00:04:21.290 --> 00:04:23.410
Calm down, you two!

00:04:23.410 --> 00:04:27.950
Stop fighting! Let's all just get along!

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:30.620
No, really! Calm down!

00:04:30.620 --> 00:04:32.580
That's not us though.

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:49.450
The best of the best Black Sorcerers
from the Tower of Fangs.

00:04:49.450 --> 00:04:51.620
And...

00:04:51.620 --> 00:04:53.620
A Sorcerer so powerful that he is on par

00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:56.750
with the most powerful Sorcerers,
the Thirteen Apostles...

00:04:56.750 --> 00:04:59.330
Childman.

00:04:59.330 --> 00:05:01.080
Am I going to be able to defeat them?

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:04.750
Get a grip.

00:05:04.750 --> 00:05:08.040
I'm going to find Azalie before they do.

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:10.250
If I don't,

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:12.080
Azalie will die.

00:05:20.660 --> 00:05:23.870
I feel it... Her presence.

00:05:26.620 --> 00:05:29.750
It might be lunacy to shout here, but...

00:05:29.750 --> 00:05:31.370
But I only got this far

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:33.950
because I always trusted my gut instincts.

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:37.620
Azalie!

00:05:56.790 --> 00:05:59.700
Azalie!

00:06:05.580 --> 00:06:07.250
She responded?!

00:06:20.540 --> 00:06:22.410
Why did she set the forest on fire?

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:30.200
Azalie, it's me! Let's go! At this rate...

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:39.660
Azalie, it's me! Can't you tell?

00:06:43.250 --> 00:06:46.410
She cleared part of this forest
so that she could fight.

00:06:46.410 --> 00:06:49.000
Gather at my command, Shield of Amber!

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:54.040
Have you completely lost yourself, Azalie?

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:02.000
Do you intend to kill me?

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:06.660
The difference in our magical
powers is just too great.

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:16.370
I know I wanted to run away with her but...

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:20.080
At this rate,

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:21.790
I'm not going to win.

00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:34.160
I almost managed to outsmart you.

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:35.330
I'm not so sure about that.

00:07:35.330 --> 00:07:37.830
I'm pretty sure I told you from the beginning.

00:07:37.830 --> 00:07:41.500
You're the one who will lead the attack.

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:42.870
Why you--

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:46.120
Krylancelo...

00:07:47.870 --> 00:07:49.410
Repair!

00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:56.120
You do remember that I'm
an expert at Healing Sorcery, right?

00:08:27.120 --> 00:08:28.500
He's gone in an instant...

00:08:28.500 --> 00:08:31.200
Disperse!

00:08:31.200 --> 00:08:32.500
O Flames!

00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:34.080
O Wind!

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:44.450
If I can just steal that sword...

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:48.500
I dance within thee, Heavenly Castle!

00:08:52.660 --> 00:08:56.410
Without this, they won't be
able to pursue her any longer!

00:08:58.790 --> 00:09:00.700
Heartia, after him.

00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:17.160
Azalie, please manage to get away.

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:18.950
O Flames!

00:09:25.200 --> 00:09:27.700
The monster that you
keep referring to as Azalie

00:09:27.700 --> 00:09:30.000
just killed Comicron!

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:38.700
Even after hearing that, are you still...

00:09:40.410 --> 00:09:44.450
If you actually tried, you'd be able
to fight Azalie on equal ground.

00:09:44.450 --> 00:09:50.500
If you had actually helped us,
Comicron may not have died!

00:09:50.500 --> 00:09:51.910
So please...

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:56.500
I won't kill her.
I'll return her to her original state.

00:09:56.500 --> 00:09:59.250
There's no way to return
her to her original state.

00:09:59.250 --> 00:10:03.290
She's the only one who figured
out how to use that sword.

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:07.830
If you don't give me that sword,
it'll mean we're going to have to fight.

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:11.870
O Shadows!

00:10:17.450 --> 00:10:19.040
I release thee--

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:28.580
I erase thee, Footprints of Evil!

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:42.120
Do we really have to fight?

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:50.660
Save us!

00:10:52.790 --> 00:10:54.450
Orphen!

00:10:54.450 --> 00:10:55.330
Claiomh?!

00:10:55.330 --> 00:10:58.370
This is your jurisdiction, Black Sorcerer!

00:11:00.620 --> 00:11:03.540
I unsheathe thee, Sword of Light!

00:11:08.620 --> 00:11:10.370
That was a Hairy Howler.

00:11:10.370 --> 00:11:11.950
It startles its prey with its roar,

00:11:11.950 --> 00:11:14.910
then makes their prey run
around until they're exhausted,

00:11:14.910 --> 00:11:17.040
then goes in for the attack.

00:11:17.040 --> 00:11:19.370
So, what the heck are you doing here?

00:11:19.370 --> 00:11:22.370
Like I had a choice! I was worried about you!

00:11:23.830 --> 00:11:25.950
Heartia.

00:11:25.950 --> 00:11:30.120
What you're trying to say may not be wrong.

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:33.450
But I'm going to do what I think is right.

00:11:33.450 --> 00:11:36.910
I won't let anyone else die.

00:11:36.910 --> 00:11:38.790
You guys stay here.

00:11:38.790 --> 00:11:40.040
Don't you dare move.

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:41.540
Okay...

00:11:49.750 --> 00:11:50.910
They were wiped out...?

00:11:50.910 --> 00:11:52.620
No, look over there!

00:11:54.200 --> 00:11:56.700
Hark, O Light!

00:11:57.580 --> 00:12:01.750
She's defending herself against
Master's attack with Sorcery?

00:12:01.750 --> 00:12:05.870
Azalie hasn't used White Sorcery
ever since she appeared.

00:12:05.870 --> 00:12:08.200
Maybe she can't use it anymore.

00:12:18.290 --> 00:12:19.500
O Wall!

00:12:25.700 --> 00:12:27.330
Chainmail of Haloes!

00:12:30.660 --> 00:12:32.200
You're going to save me?

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:35.200
It's not like I want you to die.

00:12:38.000 --> 00:12:39.870
But she's just too powerful.

00:12:41.120 --> 00:12:43.410
It's like she's as powerful as you,

00:12:43.410 --> 00:12:47.160
even though you're one of
the most powerful Sorcerers!

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:48.830
Hark, O Light!

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:51.080
Don't!

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:55.080
I unsheathe thee, Sword of Light!

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:02.080
You sure like to keep busy, don't you?

00:13:02.080 --> 00:13:05.330
Are you just going to keep trying
to contain both of our attacks?

00:13:05.330 --> 00:13:07.540
There has to be a way to save her!

00:13:07.540 --> 00:13:09.700
There's no way that it's impossible!

00:13:11.370 --> 00:13:15.000
You've grown up to be
a great man, Krylancelo.

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:19.750
If I were to ever have a successor,
it'll probably be you.

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:22.000
Now's not the time for that.

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:29.290
Childman... why...?

00:13:29.290 --> 00:13:31.540
I'll heal you right away...

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:33.870
After I finish this job.

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:42.290
You... bastard...

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:47.750
O Chaos!

00:13:50.620 --> 00:13:52.790
S-Stop...

00:14:02.660 --> 00:14:04.410
Azalie...

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:14.830
Azalie!

00:14:22.910 --> 00:14:24.540
Repair.

00:14:33.250 --> 00:14:34.410
Azalie...

00:14:34.410 --> 00:14:37.290
Azalie, it's me. Orphe--

00:14:40.660 --> 00:14:42.870
It's Krylancelo.

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:50.830
"Kry... lancelo"

00:14:52.080 --> 00:14:54.580
"I've been... searching for you..."

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:58.250
"I'm the one who rushed that experiment...
It's all my fault..."

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:03.000
"I... wanted to save them"

00:15:04.540 --> 00:15:06.580
What's going on?

00:15:07.540 --> 00:15:10.790
"I... wanted to save her..."

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:18.910
I will return this sword to the Tower.

00:15:18.910 --> 00:15:20.660
Yes.

00:15:43.370 --> 00:15:45.830
Stop!

00:15:45.830 --> 00:15:47.330
Come out.

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:50.750
I'm sure you figured
I'd be waiting here for you.

00:15:58.290 --> 00:16:01.250
What's the meaning of this, Krylancelo?

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:05.870
You should know exactly why I'm here.

00:16:07.450 --> 00:16:10.500
Who knows? I haven't the slightest idea.

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:14.660
There are those who consider
your actions the other day a betrayal.

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:18.040
But in the end, you were
the one who found that monster

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:20.750
and lured them out.

00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:24.700
So I had them reconsider your punishment.

00:16:24.700 --> 00:16:27.000
You're rather talkative today.

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:30.330
It almost doesn't sound like you, Childman!

00:16:33.330 --> 00:16:35.660
When did you realize it?

00:16:35.660 --> 00:16:39.450
When you finished off that monster.

00:16:39.450 --> 00:16:43.160
He left some final words.

00:16:43.160 --> 00:16:47.160
Hey, why did it have to come to this?

00:16:47.160 --> 00:16:50.660
You could at least respond to me finally,

00:16:50.660 --> 00:16:53.370
Azalie.

00:16:53.370 --> 00:16:56.410
And what if I do?

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:58.080
I'll decide after I hear the reply.

00:16:58.080 --> 00:17:00.000
That's a great answer.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:03.750
I thought this when we first reunited,
but you've gotten stronger,

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:05.330
Krylancelo.

00:17:05.330 --> 00:17:07.330
It's been five years!

00:17:07.330 --> 00:17:11.200
Apparently, I didn't get any smarter though.

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:13.160
That may be true.

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:19.620
But I always absolutely
loved that part about you.

00:17:19.620 --> 00:17:22.450
Out of everyone in that class,

00:17:22.450 --> 00:17:25.910
you had what it takes
to become a powerful Sorcerer.

00:17:25.910 --> 00:17:28.370
I always believed that.

00:17:28.370 --> 00:17:31.910
If I were to ever have a partner, it'd be you.

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:34.830
The only one who could
see me for who I really am.

00:17:34.830 --> 00:17:39.910
Because you were the only one
who truly ever understood me.

00:17:39.910 --> 00:17:41.540
Five years ago...

00:17:45.750 --> 00:17:49.620
After I'd failed the experiment
to activate the sword and fled...

00:17:51.450 --> 00:17:53.790
...I lost consciousness.

00:17:56.450 --> 00:17:59.660
And when I woke up again,
five years had passed.

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:06.580
That was enough time for my beloved
little brother to become a full-fledged man.

00:18:06.580 --> 00:18:10.000
When did you switch
consciousnesses with Childman?

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:14.410
When he awakened
and tried to come after me.

00:18:14.410 --> 00:18:16.040
It was a risky wager.

00:18:20.580 --> 00:18:23.700
I thought I'd be able to return
to normal if I had the sword,

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:25.750
but I didn't know where it was.

00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:28.120
That's why I had him find it for me.

00:18:30.290 --> 00:18:31.790
When you cut someone with this sword,

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:35.200
you're able to transform them
into whatever you desire.

00:18:35.200 --> 00:18:37.540
But when I tried my experiment,

00:18:37.540 --> 00:18:40.290
I'd lost my concentration

00:18:40.290 --> 00:18:43.540
and turned into that monster.

00:18:43.540 --> 00:18:47.700
But I might be able to return
to normal if I used this sword again.

00:18:47.700 --> 00:18:50.700
Though that's just another wager.

00:18:50.700 --> 00:18:53.500
So, what are you going to do?

00:18:53.500 --> 00:18:58.160
I'm going to settle things
with you since you killed Childman.

00:18:58.160 --> 00:19:00.700
It's not like I wanted to kill him.

00:19:00.700 --> 00:19:04.370
But you should've been able to find another way.

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:08.080
I looked up to you from the bottom of my heart!

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:12.160
And I trust you, as well.

00:19:12.160 --> 00:19:17.950
I don't mind becoming yours
after I return to my original form.

00:19:17.950 --> 00:19:22.330
Azalie... Please don't betray me any further!

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:30.000
I feel like I'm being tested right now...

00:19:30.000 --> 00:19:32.910
By my old friends from the past...

00:19:32.910 --> 00:19:36.620
My life was done for the moment I...

00:19:36.620 --> 00:19:39.910
I'm sure that you can...

00:19:39.910 --> 00:19:41.370
You'll be able to...

00:20:06.700 --> 00:20:09.790
You avoided any vital points, Azalie.

00:20:09.790 --> 00:20:13.790
Regardless, you had
no chance of winning either way.

00:20:13.790 --> 00:20:17.750
I'm sure you remember the thing
that would save one from harm

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:20.700
but could only be used once.

00:20:20.700 --> 00:20:25.120
The letters on this ring say,
"Drop your weapon."

00:20:25.120 --> 00:20:30.120
Basically, it guards the owner from disaster.

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:31.410
But...

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:34.790
Considering how small that ring was,

00:20:34.790 --> 00:20:37.290
I had no problem swallowing it.

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:44.370
That sword can transform you
however I please, right?

00:20:44.370 --> 00:20:47.580
You could stay as Childman,

00:20:47.580 --> 00:20:51.250
but I don't think his body
will hold out much longer.

00:20:51.250 --> 00:20:53.910
No matter how you choose to live,

00:20:53.910 --> 00:20:56.200
I'll make your wish come true.

00:21:08.370 --> 00:21:10.910
Why didn't you try to kill me?

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:13.290
Because he didn't want me to.

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:16.000
You're lying. He was...

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:18.370
Childman was trying to kill me!

00:21:18.370 --> 00:21:23.000
You're wrong. Why do you think
he personally went after you?

00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:26.620
So that he could return to normal.

00:21:26.620 --> 00:21:31.330
Why did he allow you to switch bodies
with him without resisting?

00:21:31.330 --> 00:21:33.790
He should've been able to stop you.

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:36.410
He wanted to save you...

00:21:36.410 --> 00:21:39.750
...with his own hands.

00:21:39.750 --> 00:21:42.830
No... That can't be true.

00:21:47.830 --> 00:21:52.080
I wanted to be a woman worthy of him.

00:21:55.910 --> 00:21:59.410
I'm going... to get my time back.

00:23:38.080 --> 00:23:39.750
The Chaos Witch.

00:23:39.750 --> 00:23:42.410
Azalie's nickname means chaos itself.

00:23:42.410 --> 00:23:47.000
Then what about you,
Successor of the Razor's Edge?

00:23:45.000 --> 00:23:47.000
"The Chaos Witch and
the Successor of the Razor's Edge"
